map Blackbeard's Last Season on the Carolina Coast
subtitle 1718: the colony each ship's company feared, sheltered in, or was hunted from

tag Colony as c
  Blockaded red
  Safe Harbour green
  Hunting Us purple

tag Event as e
  Raid orange
  Refuge blue

South Carolina c: Blockaded
North Carolina c: Safe Harbour
Virginia c: Hunting Us

tag Voyage as v
  Plunder orange
  Pardon blue
  The Hunt purple

poi Charleston US-SC label: Charles Town, e: Raid
poi 35.55 -76.81 as bath label: Bath Town, e: Refuge
poi 35.11 -75.98 as ocracoke label: Ocracoke Inlet, e: Raid
  note Blackbeard falls here
    Maynard's crew boards at dawn.
poi 37.27 -76.71 as williamsburg label: Williamsburg, e: Refuge
poi 33.4 -73.6 as prize label: Prizes at sea, e: Raid

prize ~> Charleston v: Plunder, width: 8
  note Four prizes in a week
Charleston ~> bath v: Pardon, width: 4
  note Governor Eden pardons the crew
bath ~> ocracoke v: Plunder, width: 3
williamsburg ~> ocracoke v: The Hunt, width: 6
